  "description": "To convert flat 96A and 96B into a single dwelling and for a rear 2 story extension",
  "development_type": null,
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Please could they provide the following:\r\nExisting and Proposed Section Drawings (scale 1:50 or 1:100)\r\nBNG statement using the template on the website; \r\nDemolition plans showing parts of the building to be fully or partially removed (supporting photographs encouraged, especially for historic buildings).\r\nFor Buildings of Townscape Merit, or Conservation Areas, detailed plans (scale not less than 1:20) must show new doors, windows, shop fronts, panelling, fireplaces, plaster mouldings, and other decorative features;\r\nInclusive design statement (can be included in the DAS)\r\nDrainage Strategy incorporating Sustainable Drainage Systems (SuDS)\r\n\r\n2. Does the applicant own the entire buiding and site including all flats? if not certificate B of application form needs to be completed.   \r\n\r\n3. Please could you agree a new description of development?\r\n'Proposed amalgamation of 96A and 96B (first and second floor units) into a single dwelling; excavation at basement level and creation of lightwell; construction of a rear two-storey extension with lantern rooflight; construction of rear dormer roof extension; terrace at the ground floor level; replacement windows, installation of rooflights and associated fenestration alterations'."
